Dear Dr. Lintorf,

thank you for your message. The Supplier Attestation 2026-05 dated May 4, 2026 reflects the full scope of documentation we currently provide to integration partners. We are preparing a broader transparency package for downstream providers, which we expect to release towards the end of June. I will keep you posted.

Best regards
Maya Chen
